    <briefdescription>
<para>Channel CTRL register bit definitions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Bit Map:</title><para><verbatim>* Bit 14    : OLSG_WARN_EN      - OLSG warning enable
* Bits 13-9 : OLSG_WARN_WINDOW  - OLSG warning window
* Bit 8     : PWM_PERIOD_CALC_MODE - PWM period calc mode
* Bits 7-0  : MIN_INT_THRESH    - Minimum integrator threshold
* </verbatim> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
